WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.20 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Reporting and compliance to funders

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Turn every agreement into a checklist of owned, scheduled obligations.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate application, award, cash received and allowable spending.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. List obligations within a week of signing.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Tell funders about changes early; ask before acting.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: Foundation B reports due 31 January and 31 July; moving over 10% between headings needs written approval first.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create an obligations checklist for one award.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
